# Witness: a pointer to an int written through an explicit path refuses an element that holds a Structure (4).
# Norm: the book #scope, journal 2026-11-17 #l3-own-types.
# Slice C1 (plan #one-graph-plan, P1): the check lives in src/l2src/lmx_checks.lm2.
(
    Observed:
        int: seen 0
        @: q int
)
@: shared data[0]
sub: main () (A(B(int: w 2)))
    shared\Observed\q := A[0]
    shared\Observed\seen := 1
main()
